OL,3,AUS transport secretary to give update
OL,4,Aas flight disruption continues after
OL,5,Aground stop
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlights across the US have been delayed
OL,8,For cancelled on Saturday morning, as
OL,9,Fknock-on disruption continues after a
OL,10,Fnationwide ground stop
OL,12,FMore than 3,500 flights have been
OL,13,Fcancelled and more than 2,000 delayed
OL,14,Fin the US on Saturday, according to
OL,15,Ftracking website Flight Aware
OL,17,FThe grounding began at around 16:00 EST
OL,18,F(21:00 GMT) on Friday and lasted more
OL,19,Fthan four hours - here's a timeline of
OL,20,Fhow it unfolded
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
