OL,3,AUS transport secretary to give update
OL,4,Aas flight disruption continues after
OL,5,Aground stop
OL,6,
OL,7,FDuffy previously said the ripple
OL,8,Feffects could last for days - it was
OL,9,Fthe longest ground stop in the US since
OL,10,Fthe one after the 9/11 attacks in 2001
OL,12,FOfficials say the incident was caused
OL,13,Fby a "telecommunications outage" and
OL,14,Fplace the blame on old systems
